  en: {
    title: 'The Story of my Life',
    description: 'Give shape to your life story: a writing course in five weekends that combines storytelling craft with systemic work, at Homecoming Land in Brasschaat, between Antwerp and Breda.',
    heroSub: 'Give shape to your life story · from memory to a compelling story',
    heroCta: 'Register',
    introTitle: 'The film of a unique life',
    intro: [
      'Many people dream of capturing their life in a book or screenplay. The film of a unique life. A novel about highs and lows, unexpected turns, special relationships and loss.',
      'You can see the story, but the words do not come. After a few pages the writing stalls and your project disappears into a drawer. Or you write a lot, but miss the structure, rhythm or impact you had in mind.',
